[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor]
Velocidade de construção de §Yferrovia§!

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor_desc]
Altera a velocidade de construção de ferrovias.

[l_braz_por.rail_way]
Ferrovias

[l_braz_por.rail_way_desc]
Ferrovias são usadas para conectar Centrais de Abastecimento para que você possa recolher suprimentos longe de sua capital.

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor]
§YRailway§! construction speed

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor_desc]
Modifies the speed of Railway construction.

[l_english.rail_way]
Railways

[l_english.rail_way_desc]
Railways are used to connect Supply Hubs together to allow drawing of supply far from your capital.

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor]
Vit. de constr. des voies ferrées 

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor_desc]
Modifie la vitesse de construction des voies ferrées.

[l_french.rail_way]
Chemin de fer

[l_french.rail_way_desc]
Le chemin de fer est utilisé pour relier les nœuds logistiques afin de transporter le ravitaillement jusque loin du cœur logistique.

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor]
Baugeschwindigkeit für §YEisenbahnen§!

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor_desc]
Modifiziert die Baugeschwindigkeit für Eisenbahnen.

[l_german.rail_way]
Eisenbahnen

[l_german.rail_way_desc]
Eisenbahnen dienen dazu, Nachschubknoten miteinander zu verbinden, um weit von Ihrer Hauptstadt entfernt Nachschub aufnehmen zu können.

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor]
§Y鉄道§!建設速度

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor_desc]
鉄道建設速度を補正する。

[l_japanese.rail_way]
鉄道

[l_japanese.rail_way_desc]
鉄道は補給ハブ同士を接続し、首都から遠く離れた地点へ補給を引き出すこと可能にする。

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor]
§Y철도§! 건설 속도

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor_desc]
철도 건설 속도 변동치.

[l_korean.rail_way]
철도

[l_korean.rail_way_desc]
여러 보급 중심지를 연결하는 철도는 보급 사령부에서 멀리 떨어진 곳까지 보급품을 수송하는 데 사용됩니다.

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor]
Tempo budowy §Ykolei§!

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor_desc]
Zmienia tempo budowy kolei.

[l_polish.rail_way]
Koleje

[l_polish.rail_way_desc]
Linie kolejowe mogą łączyć ze sobą punkty zaopatrzenia, aby można było zaopatrywać się z dala od stolicy.

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor]
Скорость строительства §Yжелезных дорог§!

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor_desc]
Изменяет скорость строительства железных дорог.

[l_russian.rail_way]
Железные дороги

[l_russian.rail_way_desc]
Железные дороги соединяют узлы снабжения, позволяя распределять припасы вдали от столицы.

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor]
§Y铁路§!建设速度

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor_desc]
改变铁路的建设速度

[l_simp_chinese.rail_way]
铁路

[l_simp_chinese.rail_way_desc]
铁路用来连接补给中心，使补给能够从你的补给首都运输。

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor]
Velocidad de construcción de §Yferrocarriles§!

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_rail_way_factor_desc]
Modifica la velocidad de construcción de los ferrocarriles.

[l_spanish.rail_way]
Ferrocarril

[l_spanish.rail_way_desc]
Las vías férreas conectan los centros de suministros para poder obtener suministros lejos de la capital.

